Notice that in Multiling O Keyboard (new beta) Lojban qwerty keyboard 
allows adding stress to vowels. Just enter a vowel and then long-press the 
"S" button.
This gives the opportunity to enter texts in la selpa'i style (but on the 
other hand disallows to use the dictionary although this can be changed by 
improving the dictionary in Plugin.Lojban for MultiLing).


